   "fix": "Retarget the codomain to `Submodule.torsionBy R R (3 : R)` in `fixedSubmoduleEquiv` and `fixedSubmoduleEquiv_symm_apply`.",
   "issue": "`fixedSubmoduleEquiv` lands in `LinearMap.ker (LinearMap.mulLeft R 3)` rather than Mathlib's canonical annihilator `Submodule.torsionBy R R 3`, so consumers lose the `mem_torsionBy_iff` API and the `Ann_A(d_i)` form named by the consuming milestone. `fixedSubmoduleEquiv_symm_apply` (line 133) has the same codomain.",
