   "file": "TauCeti/LinearAlgebra/FixedSubmodule/OrderThree.lean",
   "fix": "Add a characteristic lemma such as `LinearMap.toMatrix' (automorphism R).toLinearMap = matrix R` (or `(automorphism R).toLinearMap = Matrix.toLin' (matrix R)`), proved by `(rfl)` or `simp`.",
   "issue": "`automorphism` is an unexposed `noncomputable def`, but `diagonalization` (line 79) is stated only about `matrix R - 1`. No exported lemma relates `automorphism R` to `matrix R`, so the advertised `\u03b3Y-I` diagonalization cannot be applied to the automorphism without unfolding.",
